1
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:19,999
Thanks to Mother and Jesus. I took the covenant on 30-12-2022. I had already known about it before I took the covenant here.

2
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:30,999
In October, October month of 2022, I had a lot of pain in the neck area.

3
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:41,999
Pain in the neck area, headaches, vomiting, and also back pain. That is, pain in the middle, also called neck pain

4
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:49,999
which comes from the back, it was unbearable pain. One day my mother brought a medicine.

5
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:59,999
After that, Bolinio or Gell, she brought a tube. After that, I would consume it completely for one hour or half an hour

6
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:02,999
that much of a pain it was. The pain was so much that I had it in

7
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:08,999
the neck area, morning or night, I had no sleep, nothing at all. By October, at night,

8
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:18,999
sometimes I would see the contents of Kreupasanam. Whenever I saw it, I would do light candle prayer

9
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:25,999
online, and I had also taken the covenant online. At that time, I told Mother, “Mother,

10
00:01:26,000 --> 00:01:32,999
if you remove this pain for me, I will come here and testify no matter what.” That’s what I said. So one day,

11
00:01:33,000 --> 00:01:41,999
by mid-October, the pain in the neck and back I had, as well as headaches, vomiting.

12
00:01:42,000 --> 00:01:50,999
It was unbearable. Even the severe pain that started didn’t go away the next day, so my mother and my elder brother took me to the hospital.

13
00:01:51,000 --> 00:01:59,999
At the hospital, when they did a blood test, they said it was a normal infection found in blood, and the blood count was slightly high or low. So they admitted me.

14
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:04,999
They admitted me and said that because of the back pain, there might be some complaint with the disc,

15
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:11,999
which would get better. They told us that we could do physiotherapy and other treatments. So they admitted me,

16
00:02:12,000 --> 00:02:24,999
and for five days I took antibiotics and did physiotherapy for four days. On the last day, that is, the day of discharge, when I took physiotherapy, I couldn’t even stand upright.

17
00:02:25,000 --> 00:02:31,999
That is, I couldn’t see anything with my eyes. I didn’t know anything. I couldn’t see forward at

18
00:02:32,000 --> 00:02:36,999
all. Then the doctor came and discharged me. I didn’t tell them how much difficulty I was in.

19
00:02:37,000 --> 00:02:43,999
When I reached home, my elder brother asked me, “Hey, do you feel something in your eyes? Why are you eyes like this?” Then

20
00:02:44,000 --> 00:02:47,999
my left eye had shifted to one side.

21
00:02:48,000 --> 00:02:58,999
That is, I couldn’t see anything with that eye. There was no other problem. Within five days, I had completely lost vision in that eye. I didn’t know the reason.

22
00:02:59,000 --> 00:03:04,999
By the next day, my father and mother again took me to the hospital.

23
00:03:05,000 --> 00:03:11,999
Until that time, for 21 years, I never had any problem with my eyes or vision. That day, when I got out

24
00:03:12,000 --> 00:03:17,999
of the vehicle, I couldn’t see with either eye. I got out of the vehicle and went to the hospital, and the doctor

25
00:03:18,000 --> 00:03:28,999
seriously examined me and referred me to an eye specialist. The doctor said there was an infection in the optic nerve and that it needed serious attention.

26
00:03:29,000 --> 00:03:34,999
So they admitted me again. That is, after lying in the hospital for five days, I was discharged for one day, but the next day…

27
00:03:35,000 --> 00:03:39,999
Again, I went to the hospital and was admitted. After admitting me, it felt so much pain,

28
00:03:40,000 --> 00:03:50,999
I was in so much pain that I couldn’t even go for an X-Ray on the hospital bed, sitting in a wheelchair. I couldn’t stand or walk at all.

29
00:03:51,000 --> 00:03:59,999
On top of that, I had no vision in both eyes. To move, I needed help from either my father or my mother. I couldn’t do anything on my own.

30
00:04:00,000 --> 00:04:06,999
That’s when they did an MRI. Initially, the doctor said it might be meningitis,

31
00:04:07,000 --> 00:04:14,999
and that’s why it was happening. After a few days, the doctor said, “Let’s check bone marrow

32
00:04:15,000 --> 00:04:19,999
pressure, we need to see the pressure in the body.” So the doctor checked the body pressure,

33
00:04:20,000 --> 00:04:30,999
and it was extremely high. But all this checking lasted for about two weeks. In those two weeks, the pain I experienced—I can hardly

34
00:04:31,000 --> 00:04:40,999
explain it. I couldn’t stand, sit, or lie down. My middle body felt like it was breaking and tearing apart. Each time a pain came,

35
00:04:41,000 --> 00:04:49,999
I would recite the faith prayers there. After reciting, I felt relief. After reciting the faith creed, there was comfort.

36
00:04:50,000 --> 00:05:00,999
After that, when the doctor checked the pressure again, it was extremely high. They said, “Should we take another MRI?” So they did. The MRI showed a block in my head,

37
00:05:01,000 --> 00:05:06,999
meaning that blood could not flow through the vein connected to my eyes. That’s why I lost my

38
00:05:07,000 --> 00:05:12,999
vision. At that time, my aunt had already taken the covenant here. She came to me and said,

39
00:05:13,000 --> 00:05:19,999
“Don’t be afraid. Mother is here. Mother is with you. Mother will remove everything for you. Nothing bad will happen to you.”

40
00:05:20,000 --> 00:05:29,999
Then I thought, “Now, who can do anything? Nothing is possible.” But somewhere, there was faith. From that time, my

41
00:05:30,000 --> 00:05:36,999
aunt would say, “Pray, Pilgrim Mother will come. Pray, Pilgrim Mother will come.” She said that if I prayed, Mother would come.

42
00:05:37,000 --> 00:05:42,999
She told me that every time I went to different places for each blood test, for each scanning, every single time,

43
00:05:43,000 --> 00:05:51,999
if I recited the faith creed and said, “Pilgrim Mother, please come,” I received a strength I had never felt before, and even a little bit of the pain would decrease.

44
00:05:52,000 --> 00:06:00,999
That’s how it was. Initially, the doctors at the first hospital said they couldn’t show or do anything here.

45
00:06:01,000 --> 00:06:07,999
They said a stent needed to be placed in the head to remove the block and allow correct blood flow, but they couldn’t do it there.

46
00:06:08,000 --> 00:06:17,999
So they transferred me to another hospital. At the time of transferring to that hospital, it was either December 7th or 6th.

47
00:06:18,000 --> 00:06:24,999
They told me the operation date. That is, when the doctor came on the 5th, my aunt came to me, gave me

48
00:06:25,000 --> 00:06:30,999
this covenant medal in hand, and applied it on my head while reciting the faith prayers. After applying the holy oil, she said,

49
00:06:31,000 --> 00:06:41,999
“See, nothing will go wrong. You will be fine tomorrow. You will have no problems,” she reassured me. Then the doctor came and showed us the MRI,

50
00:06:42,000 --> 00:06:51,999
pointing out that the problem was exactly here. This is the issue, and tomorrow a similar procedure will be done, a stent will be placed. After that,

51
00:06:52,000 --> 00:06:58,999
it will take some time for our body to adapt. There will be severe pain in the head, but eventually, after a few days, it will settle down.

52
00:06:59,000 --> 00:07:06,999
I was okay with everything because in my mind, I always recited the faith prayers and believed that Mother would come. I had that unwavering faith.

53
00:07:07,000 --> 00:07:14,999
“Pilgrim Mother will come.” I always had this belief. I didn’t have much else in my mind—just that one phrase, “Pilgrim Mother will come.”

54
00:07:15,000 --> 00:07:21,999
That’s how my aunt gave me the holy oil and covenant medal in hand, and I recited the faith prayers. After that,

55
00:07:22,000 --> 00:07:29,999
after an hour or half an hour, I started feeling okay. By the time I was transferred to the other hospital, I didn’t feel much vomiting.

56
00:07:30,000 --> 00:07:34,999
But after that, I had severe vomiting. It was unbearable.

57
00:07:35,000 --> 00:07:46,999
The next day, even before taking me to the operation theater, my father came holding a plate-like object to help with the vomiting. I couldn’t bear it.

58
00:07:47,000 --> 00:07:54,999
Even a grain of rice or a drop of water inside would come out terribly.

59
00:07:55,000 --> 00:07:58,999
Those who have experienced this can understand it.

60
00:07:59,000 --> 00:08:05,999
That’s how it was. In the operation theater, the doctor said, “No problem, everything will be okay.”

61
00:08:06,000 --> 00:08:15,999
Then the anesthesiologist came and said, “We need to anesthetize you.” Before that, I just recited, “Mother, please come,” the faith prayers.

62
00:08:16,000 --> 00:08:21,999
I remember reciting the faith prayers, and then the anesthesiologist counted, “One, two, three.” After that, the next thing I remember is

63
00:08:22,000 --> 00:08:29,999
the doctor tapping my jaw and saying, “Everything is okay now.” At that moment, I thought, everything is okay—the operation was complete.

64
00:08:30,000 --> 00:08:35,999
The operation was over. That’s why sometimes when the doctor says everything will be okay, I wonder if it will really be like that. Then I

65
00:08:36,000 --> 00:08:43,999
was just moved to observation for a little while after the operation. I shook my head gently

66
00:08:44,000 --> 00:08:53,999
to check, and when I did, I felt no pain at all. I thought, the doctor said yesterday that I would have some pain and it would take time to recover,

67
00:08:54,000 --> 00:08:59,999
but when I moved my head like that, there was no pain. After an hour or two,

68
00:09:00,000 --> 00:09:04,999
they shifted me to the room. Even then, I had no idea. When the room was opened,

69
00:09:05,000 --> 00:09:16,999
my father and mother were smiling. I asked them why, and they said, “You didn’t have to undergo anything in the operation theater. When the doctor checked,

70
00:09:17,000 --> 00:09:28,999
the thing that was blocking you isn’t there anymore. I believed may be it was my Mother who did it. Yes, it is indeed my Mother, my Pilgrim Mother.

71
00:09:29,000 --> 00:09:37,999
She intervened there, and I am 100% sure. When all this pain started, I had already said, when I took the online covenant,

72
00:09:38,000 --> 00:09:44,999
‘Mother, I will have no problem.’ Even then, my eyes had little or no vision, but the block in my head was gone. At that time,

73
00:09:45,000 --> 00:09:56,999
I said, once this is over and I’m feeling better at home, Mother, I will come and take the pilgrim covenant, to say it directly to you.”

74
00:09:57,000 --> 00:09:59,999
Then, by the 10th or 11th,

75
00:10:00,000 --> 00:10:06,999
the doctor said there was no problem, everything would be okay, and that my vision would gradually come back.

76
00:10:07,000 --> 00:10:18,999
I was discharged, and that’s how I came here on the 30th of 2022 and took my first covenant here. After taking that covenant, I realized

77
00:10:19,000 --> 00:10:27,999
that within one or one and a half months, now as I stand here, I have full vision. But when I left the hospital,

78
00:10:28,000 --> 00:10:32,999
I couldn’t see my father, mother, or brother with both eyes. My vision was completely

79
00:10:33,000 --> 00:10:40,999
blank. After taking the covenant with the covenant medal, every time I went for a revisit with the doctor,

80
00:10:41,000 --> 00:10:48,999
my vision kept improving. I am 100% sure it was the grace given by Mother.

81
00:10:49,000 --> 00:10:55,999
After taking this covenant, when I open the Bible and read, Mother gave me something for the first time:

82
00:10:56,000 --> 00:11:05,999
“Your hearing and sight will be restored; be a witness before humans.” That’s why, now, I am a witness before Mother.

83
00:11:06,000 --> 00:11:13,999
I say that all the blessings I have received after taking the covenant, even until today, I believe Mother is always with me.

84
00:11:14,000 --> 00:11:21,999
Thanks be to Mother and Jesus. As an act of mercy, when I get newsletters here, I will go with three or four bundles.

85
00:11:22,000 --> 00:11:27,999
But when I give it this way, if someone says they don’t need it, then the person besides says-  "if they don't want it, there’s no problem, give it to us"

86
00:11:28,000 --> 00:11:31,999
It's Kreupasanam newsletter, we will read it.

87
00:11:32,000 --> 00:11:36,999
Whenever someone wants it, no matter where they go—whether it’s a public place, a bus stand, a church,

88
00:11:37,000 --> 00:11:42,999
or the place where I am working—they will receive it. I will carry a newsletter everywhere.

89
00:11:43,000 --> 00:11:51,999
And whenever possible, I distribute it in a way that reaches. I have also given everything I can to orphanages and poor children,

90
00:11:52,000 --> 00:11:59,999
providing all the necessary items they need. I will confess once a month, I make sure to offer at least once.

91
00:12:00,000 --> 00:12:07,999
I attend Sunday Mass without fail. I thank Jesus and Mother for giving me this blessing, and for embracing and loving my family—my father, mother, and all my family.

92
00:12:08,000 --> 00:12:10,999
Thanks be to Mother for wrapping my family in love.

93
00:12:11,000 --> 00:12:24,999
The Gospel of St. John 15:26 says: “When the Helper, the Spirit of truth, comes from the Father, He will testify about me.”

94
00:12:25,000 --> 00:12:39,999
Beloved in Jesus, Shreya Rosemary Kumbalangy’s testimony is now before us. What she has said is a covenant. In life, she engages in missionary work,

95
00:12:40,000 --> 00:12:47,999
fasting, participating in Mass with devotion, and active involvement with zeal. She buys four or five bags of newsletters,

96
00:12:48,000 --> 00:12:57,999
delivering them to various places, giving testimony to those who receive them, and spreading knowledge to those who are unaware.

97
00:12:58,000 --> 00:13:08,999
She deepens the faith of those who know, and with faithfulness, dedication, and truthfulness, Pilgrim Mother is with this girl. She comes here

98
00:13:09,000 --> 00:13:23,999
to give testimony, and this is the blessing given by the Holy Mother. Be strong and courageous; do not be afraid or dismayed. Wherever you go, I will be among you.

99
00:13:24,000 --> 00:13:33,999
By the power of this word, remember how Mother wonderfully helped that girl. Through Mother, give countless thanks to Jesus.

100
00:13:34,000 --> 00:13:45,999
Let us clap our hands and celebrate these extraordinary divine experiences. If you haven’t subscribed to this YouTube channel yet,

101
00:13:46,000 --> 00:13:50,000
subscribe now, share this video with your friends, and become a messenger of the Lord!
